# NIRBHAYA frontend configuration
#
# The frontend calls the Flask API through the same-origin /api path.
# During development, vite.config.ts proxies /api to http://localhost:5000.
# No frontend secret or API key belongs in this file.
#
# If you deploy the frontend and API on different origins, add a reverse proxy
# for /api or update the fetch base paths and backend CORS_ORIGINS together.
